OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers die
OL,6,Fout through the evening and winds
OL,7,Fease. With long clear spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping it will be a chilly night
OL,9,Fwith a risk of frost in sheltered
OL,10,Fspots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA chilly start to a dry
OL,13,Fmorning with long sunny spells.
OL,14,FIncreasing cloud brings rain to
OL,15,Fwestern parts by mid-afternoon and all
OL,16,Fby evening, the rain becoming heavy in
OL,17,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
