OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,6,FOccasionally heavy rain soon clearing
OL,7,FFriday morning then sunny spells and
OL,8,Fblustery showers, these becoming
OL,9,Fheavier Saturday with northwesterly
OL,10,Fcoastal gales. Mainly dry and bright
OL,11,Fon Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
